  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Carbon Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund will stimulate capital flows for sustainable developemnt in accordance with the UN framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol.Based on the implementation of the Projects and the creation and management of carbon assets in accordance with the Marrakesh Accords of the Kyoto Protocol, the fund will also enhance the participants knowledge of Joint Implementation and carbon finance as a tool to reduce the cost of implememting obligation arising from the Kyo to Protocol,help client countries achieve sustainable developemt, and achieve a global environmanetal benefit</narrative>
  </description>
